
  <sn><md>### rclone Copy vs Move vs Sync

The three commands have different purposes. The most important difference is what happens to the **source files** and **extra files in the destination**.

| Feature                               | `copy` | `move` | `sync`       |
| ------------------------------------- | ------ | ------ | ------------ |
| Copies new files                      | ✔️     | ✔️     | ✔️           |
| Updates changed files                 | ✔️     | ✔️     | ✔️           |
| Removes source files                  | ❌      | ✔️     | ❌            |
| Deletes extra destination files       | ❌      | ❌      | ✔️           |
| Good for backup                       | ✔️     | ❌      | ⚠️ Carefully |
| Makes destination identical to source | ❌      | ❌      | ✔️           |
</md></sn>
